& [RMS_R01] is typed serde recursive capacity
  + roots all five
  + types all recursive public roots and serde_json Deserializer
  + binding external serde_json remaining_depth
  + disposition partially_enforced because external recursion exists but exact I03 byte and typed-reader boundary proof remains open
  + policy observational_only severity release_blocking

& [RMS_R02] is semantic call-depth and bound-set validity
  + roots all five
  + types ProcedureBounds ProcedureType ProcedureValue CantorProcessIr
  + binding procedure_validation validate_bounds validate_type_with_bounds validate_value_with_bounds
  + condition every bound positive and maximum_call_depth no greater than 64
  + disposition enforced policy safe_pure severity release_blocking

& [RMS_R03] is procedure type recursion and schema-reference validity
  + roots all five
  + types ProcedureType ProcedureSchema ProcedureSchemaSet
  + binding procedure_validation validate_schema_set validate_schema validate_type validate_type_with_bounds
  + disposition enforced policy safe_pure severity release_blocking

& [RMS_R04] is procedure value structural validity
  + roots all five
  + types ProcedureValue and containing forms
  + binding procedure_validation validate_value validate_value_with_bounds
  + disposition enforced policy safe_pure severity release_blocking

& [RMS_R05] is aggregate value resource accounting
  + roots all five
  + types ProcedureValue ProcedureBounds and containing forms
  + binding procedure_validation validate_value_with_bounds validate_value_collection_bounds
  + disposition partially_enforced because value and collection checks exist while I03 cross-reader byte-to-value account correspondence remains open
  + policy safe_pure severity release_blocking

& [RMS_R06] is Observer authority admission
  + roots all five because current canonical documents carry the universe-level residual set
